1
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:48,009
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:51,200
[Episode 3]

3
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:54,000
Has the passphrase been changed?

4
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,090
I'll call Xia.

5
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:55,900
Try again.

6
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:58,930
Come on.

7
00:02:01,370 --> 00:02:02,570
Puppy, open the door.

8
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,840
Louder.

9
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:09,310
Puppy...

10
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:37,840
W-Why are you here?

11
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:40,470
Shouldn't I be here?

12
00:02:44,650 --> 00:02:45,210
Uncle,

13
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,630
has the lock been fixed?

14
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:48,500
Yeah.

15
00:02:50,770 --> 00:02:52,000
-Little Kid?
-Old Auntie?

16
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
-Why are you here?
-Why are you here?

17
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:57,570
Tangy, you're here.

18
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,800
What's wrong?

19
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,870
What happened?

20
00:03:02,010 --> 00:03:03,810
-Something's wrong.
-Nothing.

21
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:05,390
You know each other?

22
00:03:05,390 --> 00:03:06,200
-No.
-Yes.

23
00:03:09,130 --> 00:03:10,590
You guys are quite in sync.

24
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,100
Tangy, don't mind him.

25
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:13,900
My brother is just like this.

26
00:03:14,970 --> 00:03:16,579
It's a small world.

27
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,280
I won't stoop to a little kid's level.

28
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,370
I won't stoop to

29
00:03:22,370 --> 00:03:23,680
an old auntie's level either.

30
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,470
You...

31
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,870
Alright, whether you know
each other or not,

32
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:28,470
let me make an introduction.

33
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:29,180
Hello,

34
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:30,240
I'm Xia Congsheng.

35
00:03:30,470 --> 00:03:31,530
You must be Yun Li.

36
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:33,260
I often hear Tangy mention you.

37
00:03:34,130 --> 00:03:34,930
Hello.

38
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,280
This is my brother,

39
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,079
Fu Zhengchu.

40
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,090
We met at the airport,

41
00:03:39,090 --> 00:03:39,750
remember?

42
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:41,970
Sorry about last time.

43
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,579
I misunderstood you.

44
00:03:43,579 --> 00:03:44,370
It's fine.

45
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:46,060
You two know each other too?

46
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,090
Well...

47
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:48,530
The guy playing cool just now

48
00:03:48,530 --> 00:03:49,840
is my uncle, Fu Shize.

49
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:50,680
Fu Shize?

50
00:03:51,130 --> 00:03:52,090
Isn't he your...

51
00:03:52,090 --> 00:03:52,430
Please,

52
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:53,630
d-don't say any more.

53
00:03:57,660 --> 00:04:00,320
You look like you're the same age.

54
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:02,630
How could he be your uncle?

55
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:03,690
We're about the same age,

56
00:04:03,690 --> 00:04:04,500
but my uncle's side

57
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:05,500
is senior to ours.

58
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:07,970
Let's go inside.

59
00:04:07,970 --> 00:04:09,470
Don't just stand here chatting.

60
00:04:09,470 --> 00:04:10,180
Let's go in.

61
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:11,990
Please come in.

62
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:13,000
Let's go.

63
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,400
Don't follow me.

64
00:04:16,690 --> 00:04:17,480
How is it?

65
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,100
Not bad, right?

66
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:19,300
My little courtyard.

67
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:24,870
Xia,

68
00:04:24,930 --> 00:04:26,240
what were you doing?

69
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,330
I was making crepe rolls,

70
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:31,080
but they're too hard to make.

71
00:04:31,110 --> 00:04:33,490
I've been trying all morning
and haven't gotten anywhere.

72
00:04:33,490 --> 00:04:34,170
Our Lili

73
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:35,620
is an expert in this.

74
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:36,690
Show her.

75
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:42,100
You overwhipped the egg whites.

76
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:44,300
And if the crepe breaks like this,

77
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:46,270
the pan might be too hot,

78
00:04:46,270 --> 00:04:48,130
or the crepe has been overcooked.

79
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:49,110
Let me have a try.

80
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:49,980
Uncle,

81
00:04:50,070 --> 00:04:52,130
don't forget to fix the air purifier.

82
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:56,060
♪ I grew used to ♪

83
00:04:56,090 --> 00:04:59,490
♪ Keeping a polite distance ♪

84
00:04:57,260 --> 00:04:58,370
L-Let me have a try.

85
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,040
Okay.

86
00:05:01,470 --> 00:05:03,680
♪ Until you came along ♪

87
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:07,460
♪ And messed up all my logic ♪

88
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:11,440
♪ I once thought it through carefully ♪

89
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:15,730
♪ The breath drawn as I lean in
on purpose ♪

90
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,550
♪ When I stand right beside you ♪

91
00:05:18,580 --> 00:05:23,150
♪ Even silence starts to mean something ♪

92
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:27,710
♪ I know those fears ♪

93
00:05:27,730 --> 00:05:31,070
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

94
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:35,120
♪ Still I choose to stay ♪

95
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:38,150
♪ On your page ♪

96
00:05:40,390 --> 00:05:42,100
♪ It's you ♪

97
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:44,400
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

98
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,580
♪ Just you ♪

99
00:05:45,610 --> 00:05:48,270
♪ Are the instinct I can't quit ♪

100
00:05:48,370 --> 00:05:49,750
♪ It's always you ♪

101
00:05:49,770 --> 00:05:52,090
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

102
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:55,380
♪ And keeps me company through
the endless night ♪

103
00:05:53,330 --> 00:05:54,130
Lili,

104
00:05:54,630 --> 00:05:55,540
your crepe rolls

105
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:57,070
look so beautiful!

106
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,450
♪ It's you ♪

107
00:05:57,470 --> 00:05:59,450
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

108
00:05:58,570 --> 00:05:59,740
Our Lili is an expert

109
00:05:59,470 --> 00:06:00,700
♪ Just you ♪

110
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:00,800
in this field.

111
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:03,700
♪ All my heart defaults to ♪

112
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,100
Besides crepe rolls,

113
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:04,190
she can make a lot of other desserts.

114
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,670
♪ It's always you ♪

115
00:06:04,330 --> 00:06:05,300
Amazing.

116
00:06:04,690 --> 00:06:05,760
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

117
00:06:05,630 --> 00:06:06,570
My job

118
00:06:05,790 --> 00:06:08,480
♪ Every ordinary season ♪

119
00:06:06,570 --> 00:06:08,700
is to learn a little bit of everything.

120
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:12,230
♪ It's you ♪

121
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,310
It looks delicious!

122
00:06:15,570 --> 00:06:16,370
It's tasty!

123
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:18,480
It's really good.

124
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,540
Better than the ones bought in stores.

125
00:06:20,540 --> 00:06:21,330
Really?

126
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:25,070
How did you two meet?

127
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:27,800
When I went back to Nanwu,

128
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,390
I bumped into Lili at the airport.

129
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:30,370
I asked her to add me on WeChat,

130
00:06:30,370 --> 00:06:31,740
but she turned me down.

131
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:33,600
I told her that EAW

132
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:35,100
was run by Qingsong.

133
00:06:35,130 --> 00:06:36,590
But she didn't believe me.

134
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:40,370
So Mr. Xu is really your brother?

135
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,430
We are sort of relatives.

136
00:06:42,570 --> 00:06:43,300
My great-aunt

137
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:45,300
is Qingsong's adoptive godmother.

138
00:06:45,370 --> 00:06:46,180
Uncle,

139
00:06:46,180 --> 00:06:46,690
it's delicious.

140
00:06:46,690 --> 00:06:47,430
Have a try.

141
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,200
Is it good?

142
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,930
-I told you it's delicious.
-Lili,

143
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:05,130
come over often when you're free,

144
00:07:05,130 --> 00:07:07,060
so I can learn a few skills from you.

145
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,300
She's here to do a shop tour video.

146
00:07:10,300 --> 00:07:11,700
How could she come often?

147
00:07:11,770 --> 00:07:12,430
Lili is going

148
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:14,290
to study for her master's at NUST.

149
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:15,500
She's not going back.

150
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:16,540
Lili,

151
00:07:17,130 --> 00:07:18,180
we are alumni.

152
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,970
You should call her Senior.

153
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,240
That would sound too distant,

154
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,120
right, Lili?

155
00:07:24,570 --> 00:07:26,420
Have you found a place to live?

156
00:07:26,770 --> 00:07:27,630
Not yet.

157
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:28,920
Tangy and I are planning

158
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,330
to go house-hunting tomorrow.

159
00:07:30,330 --> 00:07:31,760
Why bother looking for a place?

160
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:32,900
I have so many rooms here.

161
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:34,590
Just pick one and move in.

162
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:37,540
Xia, stop joking.

163
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,120
Lili is still a student

164
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,380
and doesn't have a job.

165
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:41,780
Living here long-term,

166
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:43,370
she won't be able to afford it.

167
00:07:43,370 --> 00:07:44,970
I'll give you a 50% discount.

168
00:07:45,810 --> 00:07:47,240
I don't think that's a good idea.

169
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,070
It's okay.

170
00:07:48,310 --> 00:07:49,050
Just move in.

171
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:49,810
Consider it

172
00:07:49,810 --> 00:07:51,220
tuition for teaching me

173
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:52,070
how to make desserts.

174
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:53,510
No, I can't.

175
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:54,510
It's really okay.

176
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:56,240
Don't worry about the money.

177
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,370
You can pay me back slowly

178
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:58,830
after you find a job.

179
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:01,040
Since Xia said so,

180
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,220
just stay here.

181
00:08:04,830 --> 00:08:06,630
Then thank you, Xia.

182
00:08:06,630 --> 00:08:07,540
Once I get an internship,

183
00:08:07,540 --> 00:08:08,930
I'll pay the rent.

184
00:08:08,930 --> 00:08:10,040
It's fine. No rush.

185
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:11,750
Great.

186
00:08:12,270 --> 00:08:12,810
Lili,

187
00:08:12,810 --> 00:08:13,480
if you live here,

188
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:13,870
we can

189
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:14,930
go to school together.

190
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:16,130
What's so good about it?

191
00:08:16,130 --> 00:08:17,270
I'm warning you,

192
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:18,720
people like you who hit on girls

193
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,010
and ask for their WeChat

194
00:08:20,010 --> 00:08:21,270
should stay away from our Lili.

195
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:23,100
I'd call this fate with Lili.

196
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:26,270
You're destined to cross paths

197
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,430
with every pretty girl.

198
00:08:27,430 --> 00:08:28,330
Xia Congsheng,

199
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,010
when Sang Zhi and I

200
00:08:30,010 --> 00:08:30,930
had our parents called in,

201
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,370
you thought her brother was handsome

202
00:08:32,370 --> 00:08:34,429
and asked for his WeChat, didn't you?

203
00:08:35,530 --> 00:08:37,059
Why are you bringing him up?

204
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:46,120
Speaking of WeChat,

205
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:47,510
our Lili

206
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:49,130
has never taken the initiative

207
00:08:49,130 --> 00:08:50,940
to ask for someone's WeChat.

208
00:08:54,940 --> 00:08:57,200
Actually, I have.

209
00:08:58,650 --> 00:08:59,750
When?

210
00:09:00,010 --> 00:09:01,270
How come I didn't know?

211
00:09:02,290 --> 00:09:03,370
Is he handsome?

212
00:09:08,650 --> 00:09:09,150
Yeah.

213
00:09:10,860 --> 00:09:11,720
Did you add him?

214
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,670
No, I didn't.

215
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:17,900
Someone actually rejected you?

216
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,010
What happened?

217
00:09:19,010 --> 00:09:19,750
Tell us,

218
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:20,880
so we can analyze it.

219
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:22,290
It's nothing.

220
00:09:22,860 --> 00:09:24,620
Maybe it's my own problem.

221
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,220
How could it be your problem?

222
00:09:26,220 --> 00:09:27,820
It must be the guy's problem.

223
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:29,200
How could it be

224
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,200
the guy's problem?

225
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,530
It must be the girl's...

226
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,890
It's definitely the guy's problem.

227
00:09:36,890 --> 00:09:38,150
And it's a big problem.

228
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,860
A big problem!

229
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:43,790
Maybe it's the first time

230
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:45,100
this guy has been asked

231
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:46,340
for his WeChat by such a pretty girl.

232
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:47,790
He wanted to play hard to get,

233
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,590
but now he must be regretting it.

234
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:50,870
Yeah.

235
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:52,240
He must be kicking himself

236
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,750
right now.

237
00:09:55,250 --> 00:09:56,250
But Lili,

238
00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:58,100
could it be because the guy

239
00:09:58,100 --> 00:09:59,100
has a girlfriend?

240
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:03,790
Right, Uncle?

241
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:17,530
Is it possible

242
00:10:18,030 --> 00:10:19,560
that when he said "No need,"

243
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,530
he meant the cold medicine?

244
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:32,340
What cold medicine?

245
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:37,620
How about

246
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:38,820
we add each other now?

247
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:40,540
I promise I won't reject you.

248
00:10:42,310 --> 00:10:43,100
Lili.

249
00:10:44,050 --> 00:10:45,030
Let me add you on WeChat.

250
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:46,490
I won't reject you either.

251
00:10:47,210 --> 00:10:49,050
Haven't we already?

252
00:10:50,290 --> 00:10:51,100
Last time,

253
00:10:51,100 --> 00:10:52,300
it was my alt account.

254
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:54,030
You have an alt account?

255
00:10:54,630 --> 00:10:55,600
Such a player.

256
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:57,960
It's the store's account.

257
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:00,450
You two should add each other.

258
00:11:00,530 --> 00:11:01,030
No.

259
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:01,790
No.

260
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,000
Uncle.

261
00:11:03,270 --> 00:11:04,930
Uncle, you should add her too.

262
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:09,790
Don't bother him.

263
00:11:09,790 --> 00:11:11,520
He doesn't like to join the fun.

264
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,440
I actually added him.

265
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:09,890
How is it?

266
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:10,890
I'm not bad, am I?

267
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,740
You didn't want to go before.

268
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:13,790
Now you are happy.

269
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:16,530
So he wasn't rejecting me.

270
00:12:16,530 --> 00:12:18,530
He was rejecting the cold medicine.

271
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:21,250
No wonder.

272
00:12:21,460 --> 00:12:23,200
I thought you two looked weird just now.

273
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,040
So that's how you two are connected.

274
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:26,100
It's not like that.

275
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:28,390
W-We just chatted a bit, and that's all.

276
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:30,460
That wouldn't be enough.

277
00:12:31,550 --> 00:12:32,240
Anyway, now

278
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,290
you've added each other on WeChat.

279
00:12:33,290 --> 00:12:34,500
Chat more when you are free,

280
00:12:34,500 --> 00:12:36,240
and the feelings will grow.

281
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:39,340
In a relationship,

282
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:42,100
the most important thing is communication.

283
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:42,860
You have to chat more.

284
00:12:42,860 --> 00:12:43,700
What relationship?

285
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:45,560
How come we're in a relationship?

286
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,650
There's nothing to be shy about.

287
00:12:46,650 --> 00:12:47,340
This is a big step

288
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:49,250
towards your happiness.

289
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:51,000
Be proactive.

290
00:12:53,130 --> 00:12:54,150
I'll try my best.

291
00:12:54,390 --> 00:12:55,240
Deal?

292
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,600
Deal.

293
00:12:56,940 --> 00:12:57,650
Deal.

294
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,580
Grandma.

295
00:13:08,530 --> 00:13:09,390
Time to eat.

296
00:13:09,790 --> 00:13:10,600
Look at you,

297
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,790
sweating all over.

298
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:12,790
Wipe it.

299
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:15,940
I have 2 boxes left.

300
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:16,940
I'll finish moving them soon.

301
00:13:16,940 --> 00:13:17,860
No rush.

302
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:18,630
Eat first.

303
00:13:18,630 --> 00:13:20,560
Move them after you finish eating.

304
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:25,530
Here.

305
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:33,240
Why is it chicken soup?

306
00:13:33,690 --> 00:13:35,090
Yuan loves fish.

307
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,030
I like both.

308
00:13:42,890 --> 00:13:44,220
I like chicken soup too.

309
00:13:45,740 --> 00:13:46,010
Here.

310
00:13:46,010 --> 00:13:47,070
Thank you, Auntie.

311
00:13:48,130 --> 00:13:50,060
It's Shize who loves chicken soup.

312
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:53,740
Why didn't Shize

313
00:13:53,740 --> 00:13:55,170
come to eat today?

314
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:56,630
Did you two

315
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:57,750
have a fight?

316
00:13:59,120 --> 00:13:59,910
No.

317
00:14:00,820 --> 00:14:01,750
We are good.

318
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,940
Shize is younger than you.

319
00:14:07,010 --> 00:14:08,270
You are older than him.

320
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,770
Give in to him more.

321
00:14:10,250 --> 00:14:10,820
Mm.

322
00:14:13,250 --> 00:14:14,860
Mom, you eat too.

323
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:16,890
I am eating.

324
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:17,930
Here, Grandma,

325
00:14:17,930 --> 00:14:18,790
have some fish.

326
00:14:19,430 --> 00:14:20,890
Yuan, you're so sensible.

327
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,750
I'm full.

328
00:14:28,460 --> 00:14:30,120
I'll go to the front and check.

329
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:55,010
Uncle,

330
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:57,150
you'd better drink less.

331
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,360
It's bad for your health.

332
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:02,880
In the future,

333
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:05,500
don't come to our house often.

334
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:19,160
Who are you doing this for?

335
00:15:23,530 --> 00:15:25,000
No matter how much you do,

336
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,550
no one will forgive you!

337
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:34,760
Alright, alright.

338
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:35,790
It's already the end of the month.

339
00:15:35,790 --> 00:15:36,940
Go settle the beer bill,

340
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:38,030
will you?

341
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:48,750
Shize,

342
00:15:49,740 --> 00:15:51,340
your uncle didn't mean that.

343
00:15:51,460 --> 00:15:52,790
Don't take it to heart.

344
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,700
Mm, I know.

345
00:15:56,460 --> 00:15:58,630
Some things can't be resolved

346
00:15:58,630 --> 00:15:59,790
in a day or two.

347
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,690
Just give him some time.

348
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:06,480
By the way,

349
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:07,890
remember to give Grandma

350
00:16:07,890 --> 00:16:09,150
her medicine on time.

351
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:10,050
I've already transferred

352
00:16:10,050 --> 00:16:11,360
the money for this month.

353
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,340
Didn't I tell you

354
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:13,530
not to send any more money?

355
00:16:13,530 --> 00:16:15,190
I'll go keep Grandma company.

356
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:17,250
Hey.

357
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,650
This kid...

358
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:24,360
Mom.

359
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:39,000
I've told you so many times.

360
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:39,600
Leave these chores

361
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,790
to me from now on.

362
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:44,870
You and Dad

363
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,960
just need to enjoy your retirement.

364
00:17:28,620 --> 00:17:29,710
There really is such a thing

365
00:17:29,710 --> 00:17:32,200
as the moon falling from the sky.

366
00:17:37,170 --> 00:17:38,590
Strange.

367
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,460
Not a single daily post.

368
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:46,310
What exactly have you been doing?

369
00:17:51,530 --> 00:17:53,670
[EAW Compute Platform]

370
00:17:51,890 --> 00:17:53,290
Data connected.

371
00:17:53,530 --> 00:17:54,900
Start uploading.

372
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:10,940
Uploading.

373
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:24,610
Data transmission successful.

374
00:18:31,090 --> 00:18:31,980
I'm still busy,

375
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:33,330
so I won't go to eat.

376
00:18:34,410 --> 00:18:35,720
I can't write my paper,

377
00:18:35,850 --> 00:18:37,380
so I'm not in the mood to eat.

378
00:18:38,740 --> 00:18:39,160
Yuan,

379
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,060
I'll bring you some food.

380
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:05,000
Yuan.

381
00:19:06,010 --> 00:19:07,440
You haven't eaten yet, right?

382
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:08,770
Look what I brought you.

383
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:14,400
Try it.

384
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:19,350
Eat.

385
00:19:29,550 --> 00:19:32,960
Is Professor Che still
rushing you for your paper?

386
00:19:38,510 --> 00:19:40,310
Doesn't he know your situation?

387
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:41,270
It's fine.

388
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:44,430
I don't really want to bother him.

389
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:48,700
I've been taking my medicine
on time lately,

390
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:50,300
and I'm feeling much better.

391
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:51,500
Really.

392
00:19:56,290 --> 00:19:57,000
By the way, Yuan,

393
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,640
I have another paper

394
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,510
that has already been edited.

395
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:02,660
It should be able
to get into a top-tier journal.

396
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:04,590
Since you wrote the algorithm anyway,

397
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:07,250
I was considering listing you
as the first author,

398
00:20:07,250 --> 00:20:08,660
with Professor Che
as corresponding author.

399
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:10,860
That way, you can submit your paper too.

400
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:14,960
No need.

401
00:20:16,090 --> 00:20:17,820
Professor Shi agreed to it too.

402
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:23,760
I-It's fine, Yuan.

403
00:20:23,760 --> 00:20:25,370
I said "No need"!

404
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,350
I know you're excellent.

405
00:20:28,290 --> 00:20:29,550
I don't need your help.

406
00:20:32,590 --> 00:20:33,200
Do you...

407
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,400
also think I can't do it?

408
00:20:39,250 --> 00:20:40,460
Are you pitying me?

409
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:46,380
Sorry, Yuan.

410
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:47,010
I...

411
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:49,530
I didn't mean that.

412
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,080
I just wanted to help you.

413
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:54,460
Just like...

414
00:20:55,050 --> 00:20:55,750
Just like how you helped me

415
00:20:55,750 --> 00:20:56,720
when we were kids.

416
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:57,720
I don't need it!

417
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:01,800
I don't need it.

418
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:12,880
I can handle my own affairs

419
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:14,960
by myself.

420
00:21:16,370 --> 00:21:17,900
I don't need anyone's pity.

421
00:22:05,220 --> 00:22:05,830
Yuan.

422
00:22:07,410 --> 00:22:08,330
Hang in there!

423
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,500
The ambulance will be here soon.

424
00:22:10,500 --> 00:22:11,330
Hold on, Yuan!

425
00:22:33,830 --> 00:22:35,720
What exactly happened?

426
00:22:35,830 --> 00:22:37,090
How could this happen?

427
00:22:38,010 --> 00:22:39,340
What exactly happened?

428
00:22:40,180 --> 00:22:41,110
Say something!

429
00:22:41,610 --> 00:22:42,160
Uncle,

430
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:45,610
Yuan...

431
00:22:49,270 --> 00:22:50,660
Doctor! Doctor!

432
00:22:50,660 --> 00:22:51,680
-Doctor!
-Doctor!

433
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:52,310
Doctor,

434
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:53,980
how is my son?

435
00:22:54,070 --> 00:22:54,740
Please calm down.

436
00:22:54,740 --> 00:22:56,740
The doctors are resuscitating him.

437
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:03,030
Fu Shize!

438
00:23:03,420 --> 00:23:04,940
Because of his depression,

439
00:23:04,940 --> 00:23:06,550
the doctor suggested
he take a break from school.

440
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:08,220
You promised us
you would take care of him

441
00:23:08,220 --> 00:23:09,700
and make sure
he would take his medicine properly.

442
00:23:09,700 --> 00:23:11,940
That's why we agreed
to let him continue his PhD.

443
00:23:11,940 --> 00:23:13,670
Is this how you take care of him?

444
00:23:19,830 --> 00:23:20,610
I'm sorry.

445
00:23:20,900 --> 00:23:22,560
What's the use of being sorry?

446
00:23:22,940 --> 00:23:24,880
You never really cared about him!

447
00:23:25,220 --> 00:23:27,310
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

448
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:28,810
Get lost!

449
00:23:30,770 --> 00:23:31,760
Get lost!

450
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,480
Get lost!

451
00:25:05,420 --> 00:25:05,900
Yuan.

452
00:25:08,010 --> 00:25:09,460
I came to see you.

453
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:14,890
[Tomb of Beloved Son Jiang Yuan]

454
00:25:52,270 --> 00:25:54,000
You don't like the rain either,

455
00:25:55,810 --> 00:25:56,510
do you?

456
00:26:11,090 --> 00:26:11,940
Fu Shize,

457
00:26:12,210 --> 00:26:12,910
I'm going to send you

458
00:26:12,910 --> 00:26:14,740
the first message.

459
00:26:19,590 --> 00:26:21,610
Nice to meet you.

460
00:26:24,880 --> 00:26:26,210
Isn't that too robotic?

461
00:26:26,570 --> 00:26:27,160
No,

462
00:26:27,770 --> 00:26:28,830
this won't work.

463
00:26:31,530 --> 00:26:32,740
Nice to meet you.

464
00:26:32,810 --> 00:26:35,410
I would appreciate
your guidance and support.

465
00:26:36,610 --> 00:26:38,830
T-This is too pretentious.

466
00:26:45,250 --> 00:26:46,160
Good night.

467
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:52,100
Does anyone say good night
for their first message?

468
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:53,370
I don't think so.

469
00:26:57,380 --> 00:26:59,240
Send a sticker.

470
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:02,740
There isn't any suitable one either.

471
00:27:24,090 --> 00:27:25,350
In the office at night?

472
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:35,240
No way.

473
00:27:42,730 --> 00:27:48,450
[You've got a Weixin message.]

474
00:28:13,220 --> 00:28:16,480
Who sent me a message so late?

475
00:28:23,330 --> 00:28:25,530
Fu Shize took the initiative
to message me.

476
00:28:25,530 --> 00:28:26,920
Am I dreaming?

477
00:28:33,450 --> 00:28:34,950
Be my wife.

478
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:42,080
Recall. Recall. Recall.

479
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:44,810
I can't recall it!

480
00:28:45,310 --> 00:28:46,570
How could this happen?

481
00:28:47,140 --> 00:28:48,140
What happened?

482
00:28:55,700 --> 00:28:59,770
[Two minutes ago]

483
00:29:11,980 --> 00:29:13,530
Since things have come to this,

484
00:29:13,530 --> 00:29:14,570
let me explain.

485
00:29:25,770 --> 00:29:27,200
I pressed it by mistake.

486
00:29:27,220 --> 00:29:27,940
Sorry.

487
00:29:40,010 --> 00:29:41,270
Yun Li.

488
00:30:40,570 --> 00:30:42,790
What does "Mm" mean?

489
00:30:51,140 --> 00:30:52,050
Tangy?

490
00:30:53,070 --> 00:30:54,590
Why are you here so early?

491
00:30:54,620 --> 00:30:55,990
Did you stay up all night?

492
00:30:55,990 --> 00:30:57,530
Your dark circles are so heavy.

493
00:30:57,530 --> 00:30:59,570
I didn't sleep well last night.

494
00:31:01,530 --> 00:31:03,420
Why did you come so early?

495
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:04,540
Did you forget?

496
00:31:04,570 --> 00:31:06,230
I said I'd help you move today.

497
00:31:08,380 --> 00:31:09,720
Moving today?

498
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:10,420
Yeah.

499
00:31:16,700 --> 00:31:17,230
Let's go.

500
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:18,720
Let me recharge you.

501
00:31:27,800 --> 00:31:28,930
Where are you going?

502
00:31:28,940 --> 00:31:30,000
I'm going to Nanwu.

503
00:31:30,220 --> 00:31:31,680
Why are you going to Nanwu?

504
00:31:32,140 --> 00:31:33,560
To bring Yun Li back.

505
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:36,830
I know you love your daughter,

506
00:31:36,830 --> 00:31:38,570
but she's grown up.

507
00:31:38,850 --> 00:31:39,380
You can't always

508
00:31:39,380 --> 00:31:40,640
hold her to the standards

509
00:31:40,640 --> 00:31:41,640
of a little child.

510
00:31:42,380 --> 00:31:43,190
Besides,

511
00:31:43,210 --> 00:31:44,180
if you go just like that,

512
00:31:44,180 --> 00:31:45,880
are you sure she'll come back with you?

513
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:46,880
If she won't,

514
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:48,680
I'll tie her up and drag her back.

515
00:31:49,070 --> 00:31:49,770
Look at you,

516
00:31:50,140 --> 00:31:51,570
getting all worked up.

517
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:53,680
If you hadn't been so ill-tempered,

518
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:55,270
would she have stayed away this long?

519
00:31:55,270 --> 00:31:57,310
Yun Li has been gone for so many days.

520
00:31:57,310 --> 00:31:58,180
As her mother,

521
00:31:58,180 --> 00:31:59,810
aren't you worried?

522
00:32:00,310 --> 00:32:01,640
Why should I be worried?

523
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:03,180
I trust my daughter.

524
00:32:03,610 --> 00:32:04,420
Why?

525
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:05,830
You don't?

526
00:32:06,130 --> 00:32:06,780
I...

527
00:32:06,800 --> 00:32:08,260
Let's not talk about this.

528
00:32:08,440 --> 00:32:09,720
Where are you going?

529
00:32:10,690 --> 00:32:11,690
To buy breakfast.

530
00:32:12,010 --> 00:32:12,380
Right.

531
00:32:12,380 --> 00:32:12,980
Come back!

532
00:32:16,060 --> 00:32:17,220
Breakfast is on the table.

533
00:32:17,220 --> 00:32:18,620
What are you going to buy?

534
00:32:22,740 --> 00:32:24,070
Let me tell you, Yun Ye,

535
00:32:24,810 --> 00:32:25,830
don't learn from your sister.

536
00:32:25,830 --> 00:32:27,290
You only pick up bad habits!

537
00:32:27,290 --> 00:32:27,860
Alright.

538
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:28,580
Hurry up and eat.

539
00:32:28,580 --> 00:32:29,540
It'll get cold.

540
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:32,040
Take your dad's luggage inside.

541
00:32:35,450 --> 00:32:36,000
I'm telling you,

542
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:37,700
if you take your sister's side again,

543
00:32:37,700 --> 00:32:39,640
don't even think about
getting pocket money!

544
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:41,440
Time to eat.

545
00:32:47,500 --> 00:32:49,220
If Dad treats Li like this,

546
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:51,330
he'll definitely be harsher on me.

547
00:32:51,980 --> 00:32:52,510
No way.

548
00:32:52,830 --> 00:32:54,160
I need to prepare early.

549
00:33:01,400 --> 00:33:02,400
Hello, your food is ready.

550
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,050
Thank you.

551
00:33:11,510 --> 00:33:12,990
What are you looking at?

552
00:33:13,220 --> 00:33:13,950
Give it back.

553
00:33:16,350 --> 00:33:17,700
You've grown up,

554
00:33:17,700 --> 00:33:18,960
with your own secrets.

555
00:33:19,030 --> 00:33:21,360
I don't even know
what you were looking at.

556
00:33:35,790 --> 00:33:37,330
Wow, look at you.

557
00:33:37,900 --> 00:33:39,830
"Be my wife."

558
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:42,750
It's really embarrassing.

559
00:33:42,750 --> 00:33:43,160
My...

560
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:44,900
My hand slipped,
and I sent it by accident.

561
00:33:44,900 --> 00:33:46,590
I think you're sly.

562
00:33:46,590 --> 00:33:47,460
My hand really slipped.

563
00:33:47,460 --> 00:33:48,750
It was just sent...

564
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:51,290
Tangy,

565
00:33:51,290 --> 00:33:52,740
how about we don't move today?

566
00:33:52,740 --> 00:33:54,590
It'll be so awkward if we run into him.

567
00:33:54,590 --> 00:33:56,450
What's there to be awkward about?

568
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:58,790
It is. I...

569
00:34:01,330 --> 00:34:02,190
How about this?

570
00:34:11,010 --> 00:34:11,590
Next time you

571
00:34:11,590 --> 00:34:12,400
see him,

572
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,400
you can say,

573
00:34:13,610 --> 00:34:14,650
"Hello, Honey."

574
00:34:14,650 --> 00:34:15,300
"Honey."

575
00:34:15,300 --> 00:34:15,760
"Honey."

576
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:16,500
"Honey, I'm over here."

577
00:34:16,500 --> 00:34:17,150
"Honey."

578
00:34:17,150 --> 00:34:17,900
Tang Lin.

579
00:34:18,050 --> 00:34:19,440
Be serious.

580
00:34:19,750 --> 00:34:20,540
Alright.

581
00:34:27,040 --> 00:34:28,860
I almost forgot the real business.

582
00:34:28,860 --> 00:34:29,960
Didn't you tell me yesterday

583
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:31,400
that you wanted to find an internship?

584
00:34:31,400 --> 00:34:32,460
I found some companies for you.

585
00:34:32,460 --> 00:34:33,900
And Xia found some too.

586
00:34:34,050 --> 00:34:34,840
I'll send them to you later.

587
00:34:34,840 --> 00:34:36,370
Let's take a look together.

588
00:34:36,590 --> 00:34:37,000
It seems

589
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,340
EAW is also hiring.

590
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,840
Why don't you just go there?

591
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:41,360
That way, you'll have an acquaintance
looking out for you,

592
00:34:41,360 --> 00:34:42,460
including your...

593
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:45,420
honey.

594
00:34:45,960 --> 00:34:47,090
I'm not listening.

595
00:34:47,090 --> 00:34:47,940
Honey.

596
00:34:48,280 --> 00:34:49,820
Honey.

597
00:35:13,340 --> 00:35:14,800
Have you thought about it?

598
00:35:18,470 --> 00:35:19,670
Are you coming or not?

599
00:35:19,690 --> 00:35:21,150
Give me a definite answer.

600
00:35:21,820 --> 00:35:22,340
Mm.

601
00:35:22,900 --> 00:35:24,360
What does that mean?

602
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:25,960
Are you coming or not?

603
00:35:29,400 --> 00:35:31,200
Exactly what you think it means.

604
00:35:32,550 --> 00:35:33,860
So you agree, right?

605
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:37,550
I'll take that as a yes!

606
00:35:46,820 --> 00:35:48,420
Welcome to the Light Chaser.

607
00:35:51,260 --> 00:35:52,400
MLP node

608
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,600
connections normal.

609
00:35:54,500 --> 00:35:56,230
System self-check completed.

610
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:59,400
You are about to embark on
a journey of wonders.

611
00:36:34,860 --> 00:36:37,030
Program loading is ready.

612
00:36:38,320 --> 00:36:39,710
Ready for departure.

613
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:48,880
Arrived at the destination.

614
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:50,810
Preparing for lunar exploration.

615
00:38:24,050 --> 00:38:25,840
I told you not to bring these things.

616
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,440
Why did you still bring them?

617
00:38:27,460 --> 00:38:28,500
They are all daily necessities.

618
00:38:28,500 --> 00:38:29,630
You will always find a use for them.

619
00:38:29,630 --> 00:38:30,830
We should save money.

620
00:38:30,900 --> 00:38:32,030
Why spend it?

621
00:38:34,030 --> 00:38:35,230
Puppy, open the door.

622
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,190
Puppy, open the door.

623
00:38:39,130 --> 00:38:40,370
Coming! Coming!

624
00:38:43,910 --> 00:38:45,510
Who were you calling a puppy?

625
00:38:46,860 --> 00:38:47,530
Lili,

626
00:38:47,530 --> 00:38:48,330
good morning.

627
00:38:48,730 --> 00:38:49,530
Good morning.

628
00:38:49,630 --> 00:38:50,300
Is there anyone else here

629
00:38:50,300 --> 00:38:51,260
besides you?

630
00:38:51,260 --> 00:38:51,980
Be a good boy.

631
00:38:51,980 --> 00:38:53,730
Bark for me.

632
00:38:55,290 --> 00:38:55,950
Old Auntie,

633
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:57,220
I advise you to be kind.

634
00:38:57,530 --> 00:38:58,340
You...

635
00:38:58,400 --> 00:38:59,190
You're here.

636
00:38:59,340 --> 00:39:00,130
Xia.

637
00:39:01,030 --> 00:39:01,730
Let me help you with that.

638
00:39:01,730 --> 00:39:02,130
Come on,

639
00:39:02,130 --> 00:39:03,460
I'll show you your room.

640
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:04,550
Thank you.

641
00:39:06,600 --> 00:39:07,270
Zhengchu,

642
00:39:07,290 --> 00:39:08,960
help Tangy with her things too.

643
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:09,480
Okay.

644
00:39:10,800 --> 00:39:11,550
Give it to me.

645
00:39:11,550 --> 00:39:12,150
No need.

646
00:39:12,150 --> 00:39:13,350
I can carry it myself.

647
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:18,840
Move aside.

648
00:39:25,970 --> 00:39:26,970
Just give it to me.

649
00:39:27,050 --> 00:39:28,000
With your old arms and legs,

650
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,000
don't fall later.

651
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:38,620
The room is over there.

652
00:39:38,840 --> 00:39:39,930
Make yourself at home.

653
00:39:39,930 --> 00:39:41,530
Make yourself comfortable.

654
00:39:52,090 --> 00:39:52,760
This conditioner

655
00:39:52,760 --> 00:39:54,050
makes your hair really smooth.

656
00:39:54,050 --> 00:39:55,440
And this scalp serum

657
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:56,400
works really well too.

658
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:57,360
You can try them.

659
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,730
You brought too much.

660
00:40:02,340 --> 00:40:03,550
This guesthouse is great,

661
00:40:03,550 --> 00:40:04,760
except that it doesn't have a wardrobe.

662
00:40:04,760 --> 00:40:06,760
What will you do with all your clothes?

663
00:40:06,760 --> 00:40:07,630
As long as I have a place to stay,

664
00:40:07,630 --> 00:40:08,800
I don't ask for much.

665
00:40:08,800 --> 00:40:09,630
That won't do.

666
00:40:09,940 --> 00:40:10,960
How about we go buy one later?

667
00:40:10,960 --> 00:40:11,690
No need.

668
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:12,630
I'll just put them there—

669
00:40:12,630 --> 00:40:13,110
Lili.

670
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,130
Girls have a lot of stuff,

671
00:40:20,130 --> 00:40:21,190
so I brought this over for you.

672
00:40:21,190 --> 00:40:22,360
Lili, where should I put it?

673
00:40:22,360 --> 00:40:22,840
It's fine.

674
00:40:22,840 --> 00:40:23,840
Just put it there.

675
00:40:23,940 --> 00:40:24,730
Thank you.

676
00:40:25,630 --> 00:40:27,230
Call me if you need anything.

677
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:31,590
Right.

678
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:32,590
Congsheng said there's a welcome dinner

679
00:40:32,590 --> 00:40:33,190
tonight.

680
00:40:33,190 --> 00:40:34,590
We're having a barbecue.

681
00:40:34,940 --> 00:40:36,000
You should join us.

682
00:41:01,500 --> 00:41:02,030
Uncle.

683
00:41:02,610 --> 00:41:03,860
Come eat at the guesthouse tonight.

684
00:41:03,860 --> 00:41:04,980
Congsheng is throwing a party.

685
00:41:04,980 --> 00:41:06,050
You guys go ahead.

686
00:41:07,010 --> 00:41:08,650
Lili is moving in tonight.

687
00:41:09,090 --> 00:41:10,290
Why don't you join us?

688
00:41:11,110 --> 00:41:11,860
Uncle,

689
00:41:11,860 --> 00:41:12,610
come on.

690
00:41:16,110 --> 00:41:16,920
We'll see.

691
00:41:19,260 --> 00:41:20,050
Well?

692
00:41:20,070 --> 00:41:21,460
Is Uncle coming?

693
00:41:22,260 --> 00:41:23,320
He said he would see.
